{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は舞台稽古を中心に\n毎日充実した日々を過ごしています♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲もリリースされ...\n今回の個人PVでは20歳と好きなもの\nをテーマに素敵な作品を撮って頂きました( *´艸｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん是非観てみてください‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、現在発売中の\n『ヤングマガジン』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと2人で初グラビア！\nまいまいBlogにも沢山写真を載せて\nくれていました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいもスタッフさんも\nみーんなほんわかしていて、\nとっても楽しい撮影でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もお気に入りが一杯あるよ〜>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、『BOMB』の方は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/10/15/6112022/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫にゃんにゃん♡\n恥ずかしいorz\nのに、楽しかったぁ笑\n全然キャラの違う3人でした！\nでも、こんな三姉妹だったら楽しかっただろーなぁー！\n私はひとりっ子なので、兄妹姉妹が羨ましい〜(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOMBさん、いつも乃木坂特集を\nしてくださってありがとうございます！\nありがたくて...嬉しいキモチィ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近やっと！\n少しずつ自分の笑顔が好きに\nなってきたかなぁ〜？？"}],"source":"archive"}